  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Roads Infrastructure Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to improve economic competitiveness by improving the capacity and quality of strategic national roads on the Borrower&apos;s islands of Java and Sumatra, improving road safety and increasing the efficiency, quality and transparency of works procurement and implementation in Borrower&apos;s Ministry of Public Works.</narrative>
  </description>
